# Pascal 3D editor UI icons. Pascal references "/icons/*.png" (via next/image
# AND plain <img>), which would otherwise 404 on this origin. Route them to
# Pascal's CDN. To self-host instead, drop the PNGs in public/icons/ (static
# files take precedence over this redirect) or repoint the host below.
# Keep this BEFORE the SPA catch-all so it matches first.
/icons/*    https://editor.pascal.app/icons/:splat    302

# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify SPA fallback
/*    /index.html   200
